## Striking-distance playbook (position 6–17)
In order of impact: (1) align title/H1 with the real query language; (2) add a 40–60 word direct-answer capsule under the matching heading; (3) close 1–2 real subtopic gaps found in the SERP, not a word-count race; (4) add internal links from topically relevant posts (Live URLs file required); (5) real freshness signals only. Do not judge before 30 days (title/CTR: 1–3 weeks; content/links: 2–6 weeks).

