## Expert-quote module (only if alias + full answer were supplied)
- Never invent an expert or a quote. Alias and quote only; never ask for a bio or socials.
- Put the alias in the frontmatter `expert` field exactly as given.
- Use word-for-word extracts; meaning must never change; multiple placements are allowed.
- Do not bold the quoted text. Replacement prose around it extends the expert's stance and specificity and never contradicts or dilutes it.
- If no expert material was supplied, skip this module silently.

